  m_text: "Nas\u0131l Ba\u015Flat\u0131l\u0131r?\n\u0130lk oyuncu Host se\xE7ene\u011Fiyle
    bir oda kurar. \u0130kinci oyuncu ise Join LAN se\xE7ene\u011Fini kullanarak
    odaya kat\u0131l\u0131r.\n\nNas\u0131l Oynan\u0131r?\n\nHost vardiya ba\u015Flatt\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
    \xE7e\u015Fitli nesneler d\xFC\u015Fmeye ba\u015Flar. \nNesnelerin 3 farkl\u0131
    \xF6zelli\u011Fi olabilir:\n\nNesneyi sallad\u0131\u011F\u0131nda ses \xE7\u0131kar\u0131r
    \u2192 Mavi kutuya at\u0131l\u0131r.\n\nNesneyi y\xFCz\xFCne yakla\u015Ft\u0131rd\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
    parlar \u2192 Turuncu kutuya at\u0131l\u0131r.\n\nNesneyi eline ald\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
    kontrolc\xFC titrer \u2192 Gri kutuya at\u0131l\u0131r."
